      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The settlement sat near what is Burrus Old Mill Park, but the town moved a mile east when the Chicago and Alton Railroad built a station in 1878.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Springs%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Chicago & Alton Hotel, built in 1878, still stands as the oldest business in Blue Springs.",
