      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Springs%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Blue Springs operates two branches of the Mid‑Continent Public Library, serving the community’s reading needs.",
